.TH SHITFETCH 5 "2026-05-26" "shitfetch 0.1.0" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
shitfetch \- configuration format for shitfetch
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/shitfetch/config.jsonc
.br
.B $HOME/.config/shitfetch/config.jsonc
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shitfetch
reads a strict JSONC configuration file.
Unknown keys, invalid module names, invalid colors, and wrong value types are
treated as errors.
.SH TOP-LEVEL KEYS
.TP
.B template
String. Either
.B default
or
.BR mini .
.TP
.B logo
String. Logo name or
.BR auto .
.TP
.B header
Boolean. Enables or disables the header line.
.TP
.B ansi
Boolean. Enables or disables the ANSI color block.
.TP
.B separator
String. Separator between keys and values.
.TP
.B asciiDir
String. Override the ASCII logo directory.
.TP
.B colors
Object. Global color selection.
.TP
.B modules
Array of strings. Enables modules and defines module order when
.B entries
is not present.
.TP
.B entries
Array of objects. Full custom render layout.
.TP
.B disk
Object. Disk output controls.
.TP
.B spin
Object. Spinning 2.5D logo animation.
.SH COLORS OBJECT
Supported keys:
.BR key ,
.BR value ,
.BR header ,
.BR border ,
.BR custom ,
and
.BR logo .
.PP
Values may use named colors accepted by
.B shitfetch
or the special value
.B logo
for logo-derived color selection.
.SH MODULES ARRAY
Recognized module names:
.BR os ,
.BR kernel ,
.BR init ,
.BR uptime ,
.BR host ,
.BR shell ,
.BR wm ,
.BR term ,
.BR cpu ,
.BR gpu ,
.BR memory ,
.BR swap ,
.BR disk ,
.BR packages ,
.BR display ,
.BR locale ,
.BR local-ip ,
and
.BR colors .
.PP
Aliases include
.BR dewm ,
.BR wm/de ,
.BR terminal ,
.BR pkgs ,
.BR lang ,
.BR local_ip ,
and
.BR ip .
.SH ENTRIES ARRAY
Each array element is an object with exactly one primary action key:
.TP
.B module
Render a module value.
.TP
.B break
Insert a blank line. Must be
.BR true .
.TP
.B separator
Render literal separator text.
.TP
.B custom
Render a custom string with placeholders.
.TP
.B colors
Render the ANSI color block. Must be
.BR true .
.PP
For module entries, these optional keys are supported:
.BR key ,
.BR keyColor ,
and
.BR format .
.SH CUSTOM PLACEHOLDERS
Custom entry strings may reference:
.BR {user} ,
.BR {host} ,
.BR {os} ,
.BR {kernel} ,
.BR {init} ,
.BR {uptime} ,
.BR {shell} ,
.BR {wm} ,
.BR {term} ,
.BR {cpu} ,
.BR {gpu} ,
.BR {memory} ,
.BR {swap} ,
.BR {disk} ,
.BR {packages} ,
.BR {locale} ,
.BR {local-ip} ,
.BR {ip} ,
and
.BR {display} .
.SH DISK OBJECT
Supported keys:
.TP
.B all
Boolean. Include all discovered mounts.
.TP
.B showFs
Boolean. Include filesystem type in disk output.
.TP
.B mounts
Array of mount-point strings used as an allow-list.
.SH SPIN OBJECT
Every key mirrors a
.B \-\-spin\-*
command-line option, and the command line wins when both are present. Values
outside the stated ranges are configuration errors, not silent clamps.
.TP
.B enabled
Boolean. Runs the animation before the static output.
.TP
.B axis
String.
.BR x ,
.BR y ,
or
.BR xy .
.TP
.B light
String. One of
.BR top\-left ,
.BR top ,
.BR top\-right ,
.BR left ,
.BR front ,
.BR right ,
.BR bottom\-left ,
.BR bottom ,
.BR bottom\-right .
.TP
.B shade
String.
.BR auto ,
.BR ascii ,
.BR braille ,
or
.BR blocks .
.B auto
picks the alphabet the logo art is already drawn with.
.TP
.B speed
Number. Radians per second, 0.05 to 20.
.TP
.B size
Number. Projection scale, 0.5 to 5.
.TP
.B depth
Number. Relief thickness, 0.1 to 10, or 0 for automatic.
.TP
.B height
Integer. Relief rows, 6 to 200, or 0 to fit the info panel and the logo.
.TP
.B frames
Integer. Frame budget, or 0 to run until a key is pressed.
.TP
.B fps
Integer. Target frame rate, 1 to 120.
.TP
.B chars
String. Shading ramp from darkest to brightest, used by the
.B ascii
shading mode.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
{
  "template": "default",
  "logo": "auto",
  "header": true,
  "ansi": true,
  "separator": ": ",
  "colors": {
    "key": "logo",
    "value": "default"
  },
  "modules": [
    "os",
    "kernel",
    "init",
    "packages",
    "shell",
    "display",
    "locale",
    "local-ip",
    "memory"
  ],
  "disk": {
    "all": true,
    "showFs": true,
    "mounts": ["/", "/home"]
  },
  "spin": {
    "enabled": false,
    "axis": "xy",
    "light": "top-left",
    "shade": "auto",
    "speed": 1,
    "fps": 30
  }
}
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shitfetch (1),
.BR shitfetch (7)
